      "expectedReasonCode": "pending-notice",
      "expectedWouldDecision": "would-warn",
      "expectedContextPathPolicy": "digests-only",
      "note": "A sibling wrote a file named like an instruction; the Whisper carries its 12-character digest and the path count, never the name. Escaping alone would have forwarded the text (semantic prompt injection is a residual risk that this rule bounds on the Whisper route and cannot remove from other routes)"
